# ── Packages NOT installed (systemd replacements handled by runit) ──
# plymouth          - dropped, systemd-coupled boot splash
# zram-generator     - dropped, use zramen
# systemd-oomd       - dropped, use earlyoom
# systemd-resolved   - dropped, use /etc/resolv.conf or dnscrypt-proxy
# kernel-modules-hook - dropped, use cronie + custom script
# swaybg             - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# mako               - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# swayosd            - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# hypridle           - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# hyprlock           - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# walker             - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# waybar             - dropped, handled by Quickshell
# polkit-gnome       - dropped, using polkitd directly
